[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/441940207","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/4171#issuecomment-441940207","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/4171","id":441940207,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ0MTk0MDIwNw==","user":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-01-24T15:26:58Z","updated_at":"2018-11-27T06:17:05Z","body":"**Michael Bayer ([@zzzeek](https://github.com/zzzeek)) wrote:**\n\nbackrefs are not set up for bulk replace:\n\n\n```\nfrom sqlalchemy import *\nfrom sqlalchemy.orm import *\nfrom sqlalchemy.ext.declarative import declarative_base\n\nBase = declarative_base()\n\n\nclass A(Base):\n    __tablename__ = 'a'\n    id = Column(Integer, primary_key=True)\n\n\nclass B(Base):\n    __tablename__ = 'b'\n    id = Column(Integer, primary_key=True)\n    a_id = Column(Integer, ForeignKey('a.id'))\n    a = relationship('A', backref=backref('bs'))\n\na1 = A()\na2 = A()\n\nb = B(a=a1)  # Set B.a = a1\na2.bs = [b]  # ... but then put b onto a2's list\n\nassert b not in a1.bs\n```\n","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/441940207/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/441940208","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/4171#issuecomment-441940208","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/4171","id":441940208,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ0MTk0MDIwOA==","user":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-01-24T15:27:46Z","updated_at":"2018-11-27T06:17:06Z","body":"**Michael Bayer ([@zzzeek](https://github.com/zzzeek)) wrote:**\n\nwe need to consider OP_BULK_REPLACE in backrefs, this is a pretty major omission, this patch fixes but need to review the events completely:\n\n```\ndiff --git a/lib/sqlalchemy/orm/attributes.py b/lib/sqlalchemy/orm/attributes.py\nindex c9fa91b18..c9ac11dd9 100644\n--- a/lib/sqlalchemy/orm/attributes.py\n+++ b/lib/sqlalchemy/orm/attributes.py\n@@ -1187,7 +1187,7 @@ def backref_listeners(attribute, key, uselist):\n             impl = old_state.manager[key].impl\n \n             if initiator.impl is not impl or \\\n-                    initiator.op is OP_APPEND:\n+                    initiator.op in (OP_APPEND, OP_BULK_REPLACE):  # this one fixes it\n                 impl.pop(old_state,\n                          old_dict,\n                          state.obj(),\n@@ -1239,7 +1239,7 @@ def backref_listeners(attribute, key, uselist):\n                 instance_dict(child)\n             child_impl = child_state.manager[key].impl\n             if initiator.impl is not child_impl or \\\n-                    initiator.op is OP_APPEND:\n+                    initiator.op in (OP_APPEND, OP_BULK_REPLACE):  # this one might apply as well?\n                 child_impl.pop(\n                     child_state,\n                     child_dict,\n\n```\n","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/441940208/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/441940211","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/4171#issuecomment-441940211","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/4171","id":441940211,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ0MTk0MDIxMQ==","user":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchem